Hello Yating,

For example, this is how you get a sequence of 50 nucleotides from
murine chromosome 1:

library(Biostrings)

library(BSgenome.Mmusculus.UCSC.mm9)

Views(Mmusculus[["chr1"]],IRanges(start=3000001,end=3000050))

