Message-ID: <4EC02F22.4080109@fhcrc.org>

I'd try to remove that -Dinline flag, or to set the optimization level 
to -O0. For the latter, download and unpack rtracklayer

   tar xzf rtracklayer_x.y.z.tar.gz

then create or edit a plain text file ~/.R/Makevars with

   CFLAGS=-O0

(that's 'Oh-zero') then

   R CMD INSTALL --preclean rtracklayer

Alternatively, to avoid -Dinline="' I think you need to edit 
rtracklayer/src/Makevars.common.

Martin

